      "paragraph1": "The Excelsior Hotel was born in 1975 from the Rossi family's passion for hospitality and design. Located in the heart of the city, the hotel has welcomed thousands of guests from around the world over the years, becoming a reference point for those seeking comfort, elegance and professionalism.",
